WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.368
[phone rings]

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.603
- HELLO,<i> SKYMALL</i> MAGAZINE,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.104
THIS IS RIYAZ SPEAKING.

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:08.574
- HELLO, RIYAZ.
I WOULD LIKE TO REPORT

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:12.512
AN ITEM WHICH I ORDERED
THAT ARRIVED BROKEN.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.114
- WENDELL SANDERS,
MOCKINGBIRD LANE.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:16.816
- THAT'S RIGHT.

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:19.085
- I AM SHOWING THE LAST ITEM
THAT YOU RECEIVED

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:22.121
IS THE SUPERMAN BED
WITH THE MATTRESS OF SOLITUDE.

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:23.322
- THAT'S THE ONE.

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:25.258
ORDERED IT FOR MY SON
FOR HIS BIRTHDAY,

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.593
BUT I CANNOT GIVE IT TO HIM
LIKE THIS.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:30.129
AND I'M PRETTY DARN-TOOTIN'
PISSED ABOUT IT.

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.431
- I'M REALLY SORRY, SIR.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.233
I WILL START PROCESSING
YOUR REORDER RIGHT NOW

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:35.535
WITH YOU ON THE LINE, OKAY?

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.537
- I AIN'T MAD AT YOU, RIYAZ.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.572
IT'S JUST THE SYSTEM.
I KNOW.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.507
- OKAY. THANK YOU
FOR UNDERSTANDING, SIR.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.775
KIDS, EH?

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.445
- HUH?

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:49.715
OH, KI--WELL, YEAH,
I JUST GOT THE ONE MYSELF.

00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:52.752
HAD SEX WITH A WOMAN
AND EVERYTHING TO GET HIM.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.253
HOW LONG IS THIS GONNA--

00:00:54.286 --> 00:00:55.254
- WHAT IS YOUR SON'S NAME?

00:00:55.287 --> 00:01:00.760
- OH, UM...

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:04.297
STIMPY.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.865
PRETTY MUCH STIMPY.

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:07.200
- I HAVE BOYS TOO.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.601
I'LL TELL YOU,
SOMETIMES THEY CAN BE

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:10.303
A REAL COUPLE
OF YOU KNOW WHATS.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:11.637
- [bleep] ASS[bleep]?

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.539
YOU'RE PREACHING
TO THE CHOIR, RIYAZ.

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:16.843
STIMPY, DON'T YOU GIVE ME
THAT LOOK.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.378
YOU'RE GONNA GET IT
WHEN YOUR MAMA COMES HOME.

00:01:19.411 --> 00:01:21.581
- OH, MY,
SOUNDS LIKE YOUR WIFE IS...

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:24.383
- BITCH ON WHEELS.
YOU GOT THAT STRAIGHT, RIYAZ.

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:26.619
HOT LITTLE BISCUIT, THOUGH.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:28.154
NAME'S CLAIRE.

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:29.822
BODY: TEN,
FACE: TEN.

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:33.593
SO PRETTY MUCH HIT THAT
EVERY NIGHT.

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.761
SEXUALLY.

00:01:35.794 --> 00:01:37.864
ANYWAY,
WHAT'S HOLDING UP THE--

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.398
- OH, ONE MOMENT.

00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:42.401
AND HOW OLD IS YOUR SON?

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:45.771
- 15.
- 15?

00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:48.407
AND HE STILL WANTS
A SUPERMAN BED.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.477
AH, A LATE-BLOOMER.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.746
ENJOY IT
WHILE YOU STILL CAN.

00:01:53.779 --> 00:01:56.149
HE'LL GROW OUT OF THE TOYS
ANY DAY NOW.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.551
THEY ALL DO,
AND, THE SECOND

00:01:58.584 --> 00:01:59.752
HE STARTS HOOKING UP
WITH THE GIRLS,

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:03.322
HE'LL FORGET ALL ABOUT THAT
SUPERMAN AND SPIDER-MAN STUFF.

00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:05.858
- PRETTY MUCH SEEMS
LIKE HOW IT WOULD HAPPEN.

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:07.560
MAYBE THEN
HE'LL STOP BOTHERING ME

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:10.796
WITH ALL THOSE STUPID, LITTLE
FACTS ABOUT HOW THOSE CHARACTERS

00:02:10.829 --> 00:02:12.732
YOU JUST NAMED ARE CLEARLY
FROM TWO DISTINCT

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:14.834
AND SEPARATE UNIVERSES.

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:16.636
- SADLY, SOME PEOPLE
NEVER MOVE ON.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.471
- SAD?
I GOT A BETTER WORD FOR YOU.

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:19.472
PATHETIC.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.507
- WELL,
I WOULDN'T SAY PATHETIC.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.677
- HEY, I CALLS 'EM
LIKES I SEES 'EM, RIYAZ,

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:27.680
AND I DON'ST TOLERATE NERDS.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.582
IN FACT, LET ME NIP THIS
IN THE BUD REAL QUICK.

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:32.785
STIMPY, STIMPY,
GET BACK IN HERE.

00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:34.387
- WELL, I DIDN'T MEAN TO--
- THERE YOU ARE

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.291
WITH YOUR ROUND BODY
AND YOUR CREEPY-ASS FACE.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:40.526
NO MORE SWEETS FOR YOU, 'CAUSE
YOU'RE NEVER GONNA GET LAID

00:02:40.559 --> 00:02:42.328
IF YOU KEEPS EATING SWEETS!

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.830
AND ANOTHER THING!

00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:48.634
ALL THESE FIGURINES AND TOYS
YOU GOT AROUND THE HOUSE,

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.503
WE'RE THROWING 'EM
IN THE TRASH,

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:52.405
'CAUSE THEY'RE NOT REAL PEOPLE,
STIMPY.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:55.408
THEY'RE NOT REAL PEOPLE,
SO STOP BEING SO LONELY.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:58.778
STOP BEING SO LONELY.

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:07.954
- WELL--AND THIS IS NONE
OF MY BUSINESS, OF COURSE,

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:13.759
BUT I WAS WONDERING IF YOUR SON
WOULD LIKE TO TALK TO SOMEONE.

00:03:13.792 --> 00:03:15.695
[glass shattering]
- OH, [bleep]!

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:16.896
STIMPY JUST JUMPED
OUT THE WINDOW.

00:03:16.929 --> 00:03:19.465
- OH, MY GOD.
- OH, HE KILLED HIMSELF.

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:20.566
WHY'D HE DO IT?
IT MUST HAVE BEEN MY FAULT.

00:03:20.599 --> 00:03:21.567
NO, IT WASN'T.
YES, IT WAS.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.735
I'M GONNA CALL THE COPS.

00:03:22.768 --> 00:03:24.403
DON'T YOU DARE CANCEL
THAT REORDER.

00:03:24.436 --> 00:03:27.640
IT'S THE ONLY THING
I'LL HAVE TO REMEMBER HIM BY.

00:03:31.543 --> 00:03:32.876
[strains,
then sighs]

